# Scratch files the unattended /distil run writes at the repo root. None is
# ever committed — the commit step names its paths explicitly — but the
# dry-run patch is built with `git add -N .`, which picked pr-body.md up and
# showed a reviewer a change the real run would never make.
/.distil-report.md
/pr-body.md
/distil.patch
/preflight.out
